---
// Rflect CLI: a terminal typing `rflect write`.
---

<i class="pv-bg"></i>
<div class="board">
  <span class="dots">
    <i></i>
    <i></i>
    <i></i>
  </span>
  <span class="txt">
    <span class="p">$</span> <span class="typed">rflect write</span>
    <span class="cur"></span>
    <span class="out">✎ What went well today?</span>
    <span class="out">streak · 12 days</span>
  </span>
</div>

<style>
  .pv-bg {
    background: #121117;
  }
  .board {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--pm);
  }
  .dots {
    left: 14px;
    top: 12px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .dots i {
    position: static;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pl);
  }
  .txt {
    left: 16px;
    top: 34px;
    right: 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .p {
    position: static;
    display: inline;
    color: var(--hi);
  }
  .typed {
    position: static;
    color: var(--pf);
    display: inline-block;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    vertical-align: bottom;
    width: 12ch;
    animation: type 2s steps(12) infinite;
  }
  .cur {
    position: static;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 7px;
    height: 13px;
    background: var(--pf);
    vertical-align: -2px;
    animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  .out {
    position: static;
    display: block;
  }
</style>
